# Local audit data artifacts — raw probes / diagnostics / internal review notes, NOT for publication
data/audit/*.jsonl
data/audit/*.json
data/audit/*.md
# Loose raw-data dumps at data/ root (incl. harmful-prompt probes) — not for publication
data/*.jsonl
# data/raw summaries are regenerable artifacts (raw .jsonl already ignored above)
data/raw/*.json
